[00:01.00]I PLAY GAMES!
[00:03.00]I KNOW GAMES!
[00:05.00]I've been gaming since I learned to walk!
[00:07.00]So shut your mouth and let me talk!
[00:11.00]I've beaten every Souls game,
[00:12.00]Got a thousand hours in
[00:13.00]I know exactly what's been wrong
[00:14.00]With everything you've built
[00:15.00]You went to school, you worked for years,
[00:17.00]You climbed the corporate chain
[00:18.00]But I was on the front lines, man,
[00:19.00]I actually played the games!
[00:20.00]You tell me "Start with something small"
[00:21.00]I tell you "THINK BIG OR DON'T THINK AT ALL!"
[00:23.00]You say "Scope down, make a plan"
[00:24.00]I say "YOU JUST DON'T UNDERSTAND!"
[00:26.00]You got your pipelines, got your rules
[00:28.00]Got your fancy industry tools
[00:30.00]But I got something you forgot
[00:32.00]A PASSION THAT YOU HAVEN'T GOT!
[00:33.00]I PLAY GAMES!
[00:34.00]I KNOW GAMES!
[00:35.00]YOU'RE THE REASON THEY'RE ALL THE SAME!
[00:38.00]YOU SOLD OUT!
[00:39.00]I WON'T BEND!
[00:40.00]I'M THE PLAYER WHO'S GONNA MAKE 'EM GREAT AGAIN!
[00:42.00]No deadlines!
[00:43.00]No compromise!
[00:45.00]Just a million-dollar dream in my eyes!
[00:47.00]You had your turn, now step aside!
[00:49.00]I'LL SHOW YOU HOW TO MAKE A GAME DONE RIGHT!
[00:53.00]Some old dev said "Learn to code"
[00:55.00]I said "AI CAN DO THAT, BRO!"
[00:57.00]He said "Who's gonna fix it when it breaks?"
[00:59.00]I said "MAN, YOU PEOPLE LOVE TO HATE!"
[01:01.00]They said "Design is more than ideas"
[01:03.00]Well, I've got twenty thousand of 'em here!
[01:05.00]They said "Prototypes can prove what's fun"
[01:07.00]I said "I ALREADY KNOW! I'M THE ONE WHO PLAYS 'EM!"
[01:09.00]And every time I post my plans
[01:11.00]There's another vet who thinks he understands
[01:13.00]"Try a game jam," "Build a loop"
[01:15.00]JUST MORE GATEKEEPING FROM YOUR CORPORATE GROUP!
[01:17.00]You got experience, I got heart
[01:19.00]You tear my masterpiece apart
[01:21.00]Before I've even made a thing
[01:23.00]YOU'RE JUST AFRAID OF WHAT I'LL BRING!
[01:24.00]I PLAY GAMES!
[01:25.00]I KNOW GAMES!
[01:26.00]YOU'RE THE REASON THEY'RE ALL THE SAME!
[01:29.00]YOU SOLD OUT!
[01:30.00]I WON'T BEND!
[01:31.00]I'M THE PLAYER WHO'S GONNA MAKE 'EM GREAT AGAIN!
[01:33.00]No deadlines!
[01:34.00]No compromise!
[01:36.00]Just a million-dollar dream in my eyes!
[01:38.00]You had your turn, now step aside!
[01:40.00]I'LL SHOW YOU HOW TO MAKE A GAME DONE RIGHT!
[01:44.00]They say "Who's your programmer?"
[01:45.00]I say "I'll figure it out!"
[01:47.00]They say "Who's doing animation?"
[01:49.00]I say "STOP COUNTING ME OUT!"
[01:51.00]They say "Have you opened the engine?"
